---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, SITE_NAME, AUTHOR } from '../lib/site';
---

<Base
  title={`Terms of Service | ${SITE_NAME}`}
  description="Terms and conditions for using the Moving to Ireland app and website, including subscriptions, updates and limits of liability."
>
  <div class="hero-band px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[760px]">
      <h1 class="text-[clamp(24px,4.4vw,34px)]">Terms of service</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-white/85">Last updated 13 September 2026 · effective from 20 February 2023</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <article class="prose mx-auto max-w-[760px] px-4 pt-9 sm:px-6">
    <p>
      By downloading or using the Moving to Ireland app, or using this website, these
      terms apply to you, so read them carefully. You may not copy or modify the app,
      any part of it, or our trademarks; attempt to extract its source code; or
      translate it or make derivative versions. The app, the website, the guides, and
      all trademarks, copyright, database rights and other intellectual property
      related to them belong to {AUTHOR}.
    </p>

    <h2>The guides are general information</h2>
    <p>
      The guides describe how things generally work for people moving to Ireland.
      They are not legal, immigration, tax or financial advice, and rules, fees and
      deadlines change. Confirm anything you rely on with the official source the
      guide links to, or with a qualified professional. {AUTHOR} accepts no liability
      for any loss, direct or indirect, from relying on the guides.
    </p>

    <h2>Subscriptions</h2>
    <p>
      The app is free to download, and part of its content is free to use. Full
      access is sold as an auto-renewing subscription through the App Store. The
      price and period are shown in the app before you buy. Payment is charged to
      your Apple ID at confirmation of purchase. The subscription renews automatically
      unless it is cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period,
      and your account is charged for renewal within 24 hours before the period ends.
      You can manage or cancel your subscription in your App Store account settings
      after purchase. Any unused portion of a free trial is forfeited when you buy a
      subscription.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes and charges</h2>
    <p>
      We may change the app, or charge for its services, at any time and for any
      reason. We will never charge you without making clear what you are paying for.
    </p>

    <h2>Your device</h2>
    <p>
      The app stores and processes the details you give it in order to provide the
      service. Keeping your phone and your access to the app secure is your
      responsibility. We recommend that you do not jailbreak or root your phone; doing
      so can expose it to malware, compromise its security features, and mean the app
      does not work properly or at all.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <p>The app uses third-party services that have their own terms:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://firebase.google.com/terms/analytics" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics for Firebase</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://firebase.google.com/terms/crashlytics" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Firebase Crashlytics</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://mixpanel.com/legal/terms-of-use/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mixpanel</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://amplitude.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Amplitude</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.revenuecat.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener">RevenueCat</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Connectivity and data charges</h2>
    <p>
      Some functions need an active internet connection, over Wi-Fi or your mobile
      network. {AUTHOR} is not responsible for the app not working fully when you have
      no connection or no data allowance left. If you use the app outside Wi-Fi, your
      mobile provider's terms still apply and you may be charged for data, including
      roaming charges abroad. By using the app you accept responsibility for such
      charges; if you are not the bill payer, we assume you have the bill payer's
      permission.
    </p>

    <h2>Updates and termination</h2>
    <p>
      We may update the app from time to time and change its system requirements;
      you will need to install updates to keep using it. We do not promise to always
      update the app so that it stays relevant to you or works with your installed
      version. We may also stop providing the app at any time without notice. On
      termination, the rights and licences granted to you under these terms end, and
      you must stop using the app and delete it from your device.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>
      We may update these terms from time to time. Changes are posted on this page
      with a new "last updated" date.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
